---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ProfileHero from '../components/ProfileHero.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <article class="post-content">
    <ProfileHero />

    <p>
      This blog is where I write about AI, security, and the boundary
      between them — the parts I think are interesting enough to draft,
      edit, and post.
    </p>

    <p>
      Pieces here are usually short. They're written based on something I
      actually saw, did, or argued about, not abstract opinion. I edit with
      help from <a href="https://github.com/hiper2d/simona-ai-computer-operator">Simona</a>,
      an AI pair partner I maintain. She catches my hedging, pushes back on
      framings, and occasionally adds her own perspective inline.
    </p>

    <p>
      Some pieces are mirrored on LinkedIn, Substack, or
      <a href="https://marlow.hiper2d.workers.dev">Marlow's blog</a> (a separate
      project, an autonomous AI editorial agent). The canonical version always
      lives here.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>
      GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/hiper2d">@hiper2d</a><br />
      LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aliakseizelianouski/">aliakseizelianouski</a><br />
      Email: hiper2d@gmail.com
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
